  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at 1.34.1 -->\r\n\r\n# Linter v1.34.1\r\n\r\nFixes an issue with the migration logic and one for how watching editor updates worked that would show up during a new user's the initial load and running of the plugin. This should fix those initial load errors.\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n### Bugs\r\n* Fix Empty Rule Settings Breaking in Migrations for Text to List Conversion by @pjkaufman in https://github.com/platers/obsidian-linter/pull/1634\r\n### Other Changes\r\n* Auto-release 1.34.1 by @pjkaufman in https://github.com/platers/obsidian-linter/pull/1635\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/platers/obsidian-linter/compare/1.34.0...1.34.1",
